    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "opxOSS 6.0 - Rootless engine & Debian",
      "description": "The full toolset now runs without root: opxOSS boots an arm64 QEMU virtual machine and routes tools into the guest. The chroot moved from Alpine to Debian trixie, the same rootfs the VM boots. Also new: a root-free network scanner (mDNS, SSDP, NetBIOS, SNMP), Cameradar RTSP discovery, a reworked dashboard and VM settings. RouterScan has been removed. arm64-v8a only.",
      "newsDate": "2026-08-09",
      "newsUrl": "https://github.com/OPX-Aminul/opx-oss/releases/tag/v6.0",
